cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Behavior Planner FSM"
abstract: >-
  Lane change decisions from a finite state machine and a cost function on a
  highway traffic simulation whose surrounding vehicles run the Intelligent
  Driver Model and MOBIL, built to show that a safety gate applied before any
  cost is compared behaves in a way no safety weight inside the sum can
  reproduce.
type: software
authors:
